{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38893","headline":"送僧赴黄山沐汤泉兼参禅宗长老 · 杜荀鹤","name":"送僧赴黄山沐汤泉兼参禅宗长老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻有汤泉独去寻，一缾一鉢一无金。\n不愁乱世兵相害，却喜寒山路入深。\n野老祷神鸦噪庙，猎人冲雪鹿惊林。\n患身是幻逢禅主，水洗皮肤语洗心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}